      47.85,
      379.69,
      539.94,
      438.76
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of powers vested on me under the Section of 07 (1) and 04 (2) of the statute of Co- operative EmployeesCommission No. 14 of 1990 in the Central Province, Ministry of Finance and Planning, Law and Order, Local Government andProvincial Administration, Human Resource, Education and Cultural Affairs, Tourism, Land, Trade and Commerce, Foodsupplies and Distribution Affairs and Investment Co-ordination, and Subjects which are not taken under any others ministriesI Sarath Ekanayaka,",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      451.69,
      539.94,
      498.76
    ],
    "text": "Central Province, hereby notified that Mr. Mahendra Karaputugala will be appointed as a Member and theChairman of the Central Provincial Co-operative Employees Commission with the effective date of 01.06.2015 and under theSection 04 (2) of such statute, following members will be appointed as other members of the aforesaid commission with theeffective date of 01.06.2015.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
